==Czech==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|cs|zlw-ocs|dáti}}, from {{inh|cs|sla-pro|*dati}}, from {{inh|cs|ine-bsl-pro|*dṓˀtei}}, from {{inh|cs|ine-pro|*dédeh₃ti||to give}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}
* {{audio|cs|Cs-dát.ogg|audio}}
* {{hyphenation|cs|dát}}

===Verb===
{{cs-verb-old|a=p|aa=dávat}}

# to [[give]] (sth {{qualifier|+ [[accusative case]]}}) (to someone {{qualifier|+ [[dative case]]}})
#: {{uxi|cs|'''Dejte''' [[mi]] [[ruka|ruku]]!|'''Give''' me your hand!}}
#: {{uxi|cs|'''Dej''' [[mi]] [[pokoj]]!|Leave me alone! (lit: '''Give''' me peace!)}}
#: {{coi|cs|'''Dejme''' [[tomu]], [[že]]...|Let's assume that... (literally: '''Give''' that, that...)}}
#: {{coi|cs|'''dát''' [[někdo|někomu]] [[najevo]]...|to make it clear to someone that... (literally: to '''give''' someone clear, that...)}}
# to [[put]]
# {{lb|cs|reflexive-se}} to [[start]], to [[begin]]
# {{lb|cs|reflexive-se}} to [[let]], to [[allow]]
# {{lb|cs|reflexive-si}} to [[have]] {{gloss|partake of a particular substance}}
#: {{coi|cs|'''dát si''' [[pozor]]|to watch out, to be careful}}

